msgid "Double-click on **Time Profiler** in the **Instruments** window:"
msgstr "Cliceáil faoi dhó ar **Próifíl Ama** sa fhuinneog **Ionstraimí**:"

msgid ""
"You can also attach the Time Profiler to a running process by selecting it "
"from the **Target** menu."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat an Próifíl Ama a cheangal le próiseas reatha freisin tríd é a "
"roghnú ón roghchlár **Sprioc**."

msgid ""
"Click the **Start an immediate mode recording** button to start profiling."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil ar an gcnaipe** Tosaigh taifeadadh mód láithreach** chun próifíliú "
"a thosú."

msgid ""
"Perform the actions you wish to profile in the editor or project. When "
"you're done, click the **Stop** button."
msgstr ""
"Déan na gníomhartha is mian leat a phróifílú san eagarthóir nó sa "
"tionscadal. Nuair a bheidh tú críochnaithe, cliceáil ar an gcnaipe **Stop**."

msgid "Wait for the results to appear."
msgstr "Fan go mbeidh na torthaí le feiceáil."

msgid ""
"At the bottom of the window you will see a call tree for all CPU threads "
"started, and the **Heaviest Stack Trace** overview."
msgstr ""
"Ag bun na fuinneoige feicfidh tú crann glaonna do gach snáithe LAP a "
"thosaíodh, agus an forbhreathnú **Rá Stack is Trom**."

msgid ""
"You can use the timeline at the top of the window to display details for the "
"specific time period."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat an amlíne ag barr na fuinneoige a úsáid chun sonraí a "
"thaispeáint don tréimhse ama sonrach."
